## 开发

```bash
# 安装开发依赖
pip install -e ".[dev]"

# 运行测试
pytest

# 代码检查
ruff check .
mypy {{ package_name }}

# 代码格式化
ruff format .

# 安装 pre-commit hooks
pre-commit install
```

